sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User / Client
    participant UI as React UI Component
    participant APIClient as lib/api/client.ts
    participant Route as backend api/routes/
    participant Service as backend services/
    participant Repo as backend repositories/
    participant Prov as backend providers/
    participant DB as PostgreSQL DB

    User->>UI: Triggers Action (e.g. Synthesize Speech)
    UI->>APIClient: Calls Typed API Client
    APIClient->>Route: POST /api/v1/tts (JSON Payload)
    Route->>Route: Validate Pydantic Schema
    Route->>Service: invoke generate_speech()
    Service->>Prov: provider.generate_speech()
    Prov-->>Service: Return Audio Bytes
    Service->>Repo: save_generation_record()
    Repo->>DB: INSERT into speech_generations
    DB-->>Repo: Confirm Row ID
    Repo-->>Service: Generation Record
    Service-->>Route: Return TTS Result DTO
    Route-->>APIClient: 200 OK + ApiResponse[TTSResult]
    APIClient-->>UI: Update State & Audio Player
